| !Run for !RDPServer (test build)
| RDPServer is a UnixLib program converted to Absolute (AIF). It needs
| SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport, and CryptRandom for its random
| numbers (all three from PackMan).
Set RDPServer$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set RDPServer$Choices <Choices$Write>.RDPServer
IfThere <RDPServer$Choices> Then Else CDir <RDPServer$Choices>
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error RDPServer needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error RDPServer needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure CryptRandom 0.12 IfThere System:Modules.CryptRand Then RMLoad System:Modules.CryptRand
RMEnsure CryptRandom 0.12 Error RDPServer needs the CryptRandom module (0.12 or later). Install it with PackMan.
| It runs on the desktop: an icon on the icon bar (Select: Status, Adjust:
| Choices, Menu: Info, Status, Choices, Disconnect, Quit). A 1920x1080
| 32 bpp screen needs about 9 MB for the copy of the screen.
| Test builds pass -v: every mouse button and wheel event, and Shift, Ctrl
| and Alt, go to the log, <Choices$Write>.RDPServer.Log (other keys are
| logged without saying which, so a password typed remotely isn't kept).
| To run it in a task window instead:
|   TaskWindow "<RDPServer$Dir>.RDPServer -cli -v" -wimpslot 24000K
IconSprites <RDPServer$Dir>.!Sprites
WimpSlot -min 24000K
Run <RDPServer$Dir>.RDPServer -v
